                </a>
            </li>
            <li class="share-circle-icon">
                <a href="mailto:?subject=The+Best+Answers+Start+with+the+Right+Questions&amp;body=https%3a%2f%2fwww.philadelphiafed.org%2fthe-economy%2fmonetary-policy%2f240617-the-best-answers-start-with-the-right-questions" target="_blank">
